<Behavior #provider.context apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #actor-scoped-transition-recovery (
      <Statement ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QB>
      Provider context 恢复 SHALL 区分全局最新 transition 与 Actor 自身 receipt，允许有真实持久证据的其他 Actor 交错推进，保留损坏和前驱冲突拒绝。
      </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QB>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #multi-actor-recovery { name = "多 Actor 恢复" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #interleaved (
              <Given ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QC>
              多个 Actor 共用 session persistence。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QC>
              <When ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QD>
              A 与 B 交错持久推进，再恢复 A。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QD>
              <Then ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QE>
              合法的 B head SHALL 不阻断 A，且不覆盖其他 Actor authority。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QE>
            )>
            <Case #corrupt-proof (
              <Given ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QF>
              head 所引用证据缺失、损坏或与 Actor 自身 receipt 分歧。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QF>
              <When ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QG>
              请求继续传输。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QG>
              <Then ?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QH>
              系统 SHALL 拒绝，不把未知证据视作正常交错。
              </?01M1SC5W6BECA5WTQ0540F42QH>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
